OL,3,GNEWSACostly rectory building to be put
OL,4,Aup for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parish has agreed to sell its rectory
OL,7,Fbuilding and replace it with a cheaper
OL,8,Falternative.
OL,10,FSt Martin's parishioners voted 55 to
OL,11,Fone in favour of the sale on Thursday
OL,12,Fafter constables said it needed
OL,13,F"substantial investment" of about
OL,14,F#150,000 to maintain and improve the
OL,15,Fproperty.
OL,17,FThe parish now plans to invest in a
OL,18,Fsmaller, more affordable property for a
OL,19,Fnew rector as required by law until the
OL,20,Fend of 2029.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
