OL,3,GNEWSACostly rectory building to be put
OL,4,Aup for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstable Rob Prow said efforts would
OL,7,Fnow be made to sell up and purchase "a
OL,8,Fmuch more sustainable, smaller, modern
OL,9,Fthree-bedroom property".
